SUMMARY:Wildflower Sculpture Park Opening Reception
DESCRIPTION:South Mountain Conservancy Activities Meetup Group\nThe [Wildf
 lower Sculpture Park](https://www.somocon.org/visit/wildflower-sculpture-p
 ark/?mc_cid=887616f7ab&mc_eid=UNIQID) invites you to the opening of this y
 ear’s project\, **Root System**\, a collaborative\, site-responsive expl
 oration of roots\, rhizomes\, and interconnected systems of life.\n\nCurat
 orial and artist talk will begin at 3:30pm. Light refreshments will be ser
 ved.\n\nArtists were encouraged to consider how ecological networks within
  the South Mountain Reservation connect to community\, history\, and ances
 try\, and to propose work that engages themes of resilience\, symbiosis\, 
 and environmental stewardship.\n\nPresenting artists:\nANONDA BELL\nCORRIN
 E CARR\nCHRISTINE DACRUZ\nKATE EGGLESTON\nSAMAR HUSSAINI\nHAMEWS\nKAREN LE
 O\nALESSANDRA PUGLISI\nJIMENA VEGA\nWILLA VUCETAJ\n\nQuestions? [wildflowe
 rsculpture@somocon.org](mailto:wildflowersculpture@somocon.org)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/somocon/events/316354309/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260831T144735Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260831T144735Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
